*> Mission: Demonstrate your basic "TABLE SORT."
*> cobc -x -j -free EX_SORT_CHARS.cob
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. 
PROGRAM-ID. EX_SORT_CHARS.

DATA DIVISION. 
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 
01 THE-CHARS VALUE 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'.
    05 CHAR-SET OCCURS 26 TIMES INDEXED BY SUBS. 
        10 A-CHAR PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Input: [" THE-CHARS "]".
    SORT CHAR-SET DESCENDING.
    DISPLAY "Output: [" THE-CHARS "]".
STOP RUN.

